      "judgment_rationale": "Unified Runtimes combines tenant-scoped Cloud pool status and instances with project sandbox inventory in one native route. Desktop has a real loader, App binding, typed Cloud and Local clients and a shared controller for those contracts, but workbenchCapabilityClient still wraps both active capability helpers with declared renderer provenance. Snapshot v4 therefore closes both modes to renderer_capability_authority_unobserved and promotes no action while retaining their auditable desired actions and production entries."
